  "evidence": "Text E: Increase defence spending towards 2.5% of GDP and maintain the nuclear deterrent; restore community policing and guarantee police attendance; responsible fiscal rules with OBR oversight; free personal care, seven‑day GP right, and school mental‑health hubs; end Hostile Environment while upholding the Refugee Convention and providing safe/legal routes; build 380,000 homes/year including 150,000 social, ban no‑fault evictions, and create a national landlord register. Text A: Cancel Trident, sign the UN nuclear ban treaty, and pursue NATO “no first use”; repeal protest‑curbing laws, end routine stop‑and‑search and facial recognition, and decriminalise sex work; bring rail/water/major energy into public ownership with wealth taxes and a 10:1 pay ratio cap; expansive welfare and migration liberalisation including voting rights for visa‑holding residents; no new oil and gas, stop new nuclear and phase out existing stations.",
